  "note": "TGM2 as the FBNeo core gives it (Psikyo SH-2, 320 x 240, 4:3, square game pixels). 1920 x 1080: game 1440 x 1080 pushed right, rail 480 px = 106 game pixels; 1920 x 1200: game 1600 x 1200, rail 320 px = 64 game pixels = 128 Deck pixels. The Deck pixel is the game pixel while the rail holds its plates in full form, half the game pixel otherwise (deckPixel auto): in 1920 x 1200 the rail is drawn at half the game pixel, each game pixel cut in 2 x 2 Deck pixels on the same grid. The rail is always filled: plates in reserve come back when there is room (recipe.fit), the rest is shared between the rows.",
  "deckPixel": "auto"
 },
